&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Join the Advanced Trading team within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group as a Senior Software Engineer, Backend helping scale Coinbase Advanced trading products for customers around the globe. You&#39;ll own the design and delivery of social, asset discovery, and real-time notification experiences that drive awareness and engagement across a wide range of asset classes, taking complex projects from concept to production with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end design, development, and reliability of high-performance backend services using Golang and gRPC, enabling seamless trading experiences for customers worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead rapid experimentation and optimization of conversion funnels for key trading journeys, using data to prioritize high-impact opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accelerated time to market for new features by making system design trade-offs across performance, scalability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion software engineering best practices in design, coding, testing, documentation, monitoring, and alerting, raising the bar for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with engineers, product managers, and designers across multiple time zones to translate product vision into quarterly roadmaps and high-impact outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional backend software engineering experience designing, building, scaling, and maintaining production systems, with significant experience in Golang and gRPC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record designing scalable service architectures and making system design trade-offs across performance, reliability, and maintainability in high-throughput environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform, Datadog, or similar cloud infrastructure tools, and working knowledge of event-driven architectures (Kafka, MQ, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL or NoSQL databases, third-party API integrations, and modern development practices including GraphQL and ETL pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to take ambiguous, multi-quarter projects from concept to production with minimal guidance and sound technical judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$186,065&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox&#39;s data infrastructure processes petabytes of data daily, powering analytics, ML, and product decisions for a platform serving 200M+ daily active users. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on our &lt;strong&gt;Real-time Analytics Platform team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will design, build, and scale the core OLAP infrastructure powering sub-second analytical queries across Roblox. Our team directly owns and operates &lt;strong&gt;StarRocks&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Apache Druid&lt;/strong&gt;, driving high-throughput streaming ingestion and low-latency MPP query processing. You will lead the next-generation architecture of our real-time analytics platform, combining high ownership and deep technical complexity to push the boundaries of MPP engine performance, streaming ingestion pipelines, and cluster scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and Scale Core OLAP Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;: Take end-to-end ownership of the architecture, operational health, and scalability of our high-throughput OLAP engines, specifically &lt;strong&gt;StarRocks&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Apache Druid&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize Query Engine Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into engine internals, cost-based optimization (CBO), query planning, vectorized execution, memory optimization, and serialization efficiency to maximize throughput and maintain sub-second latency under heavy concurrent load.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Streaming Ingestion Pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, build, and optimize real-time data ingestion paths leveraging &lt;strong&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Apache Flink&lt;/strong&gt; and native engine load mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive OLAP Data Modeling Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with infra, data science, and product engineering teams to guide data modeling for MPP databases, optimizing partitioning, bucketing, sort keys, and materialized views.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Cluster Infrastructure &amp;amp; Capacity&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead cluster provisioning, lifecycle management, operations, and capacity planning using &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; across cloud environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance Autonomous Interfaces&lt;/strong&gt;: Integrate AI/ML and LLM-driven capabilities within our query platforms to enable automated self-serve mechanisms and intelligent data discovery for engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience building, designing, testing and maintaining production-grade, large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep OLAP &amp;amp; MPP Engine Depth&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong hands-on engineering or operational experience with &lt;strong&gt;StarRocks&lt;/strong&gt; or adjacent OLAP engines such as &lt;strong&gt;Apache Druid&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ClickHouse&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Apache Doris&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Apache Pinot&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Trino/Presto&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streaming &amp;amp; Ingestion Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record implementing high-volume streaming ingestion using &lt;strong&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Apache Flink&lt;/strong&gt;, Routine Load / Broker Load, or Debezium/CDC pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling &amp;amp; Query Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;: Expertise in OLAP schema design (partitioning, bucketing, sort keys, indexing) and tuning cost-based SQL query engines for massive scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Engineering Foundations&lt;/strong&gt;: Robust proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;C++&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Scala&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of writing clean, highly performant distributed backend code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience operating, troubleshooting, and provisioning data infrastructure at scale using &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; on AWS or GCP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence technical direction across teams, mentor engineers, and drive alignment on complex cross-cutting initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S. equivalent in CS or sufficient experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Points:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core contributions to open-source OLAP databases (StarRocks, Apache Druid, ClickHouse, Apache Doris).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating real-time analytical platforms at consumer-internet scale (100M+ active users).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For roles that are based at our headquarters in San Mateo, CA: The starting base pay for this position is as shown below. The actual base pay is dependent upon a variety of job-related factors such as professional background, training, work experience, location, business needs and market demand. Therefore, in some circumstances, the actual salary could fall outside of this expected range. This pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. All full-time employees are also eligible for equity compensation and for benefits as described on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.roblox.com/total-rewards&quot;&gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,290&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$295,250 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roblox provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. Roblox also provides reasonable accommodations to candidates with qualifying disabilities or religious beliefs during the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For US based roles only, please note the Company may not be able to employ candidates for this role who have United States work authorization related to certain U.S. visa categories, or support future H-1B sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Agent Stack&lt;/strong&gt; team and help build eve — Vercel&#39;s framework for building production-ready AI agents. eve is to agents what Next.js is to web apps: an opinionated, batteries-included framework that lets developers write only what&#39;s unique about their agent and have the platform handle the rest. You will design and implement core framework primitives, contribute to eve&#39;s runtime (built on Vercel Workflows, AI SDK, and Sandbox), and help shape the developer experience for the next generation of AI-native applications. You will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Director of Vercel&#39;s Agent Stack&lt;/strong&gt; and will be located &lt;strong&gt;onsite in New York City&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re based within a pre-determined commuting distance of one of our offices (SF, NY, London, or Berlin), the role includes in-office anchor days on Monday, Tuesday, and Friday, even if the role is listed as remote. For location-specific details, please connect with our recruiting team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship core eve framework features — the file-system conventions, compiler, and runtime that turn an agent directory into a durable, production-ready agent on Vercel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain integrations across eve&#39;s channel layer (Slack, Web Chat, WhatsApp, API, Cron, and more) and connections layer (Vercel Connect / MCP endpoints).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the AI SDK, Workflows, and Sandbox teams to ensure eve&#39;s primitives compose seamlessly on the Vercel platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive DX quality — CLI ergonomics, error messages, docs, and examples — so TypeScript/Next.js developers can ship their first agent in minutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to eve&#39;s evaluation and observability story: test suites, scoring rubrics, and deployment-time evals that make agents production-safe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with early customers and internal teams to gather feedback, diagnose agent reliability issues, and iterate rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of production TypeScript/JavaScript experience; comfortable owning complex, stateful systems end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems concepts — durable execution, checkpointing, async workflows, and failure recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or operating developer tooling, frameworks, or SDKs used by external developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with LLM APIs and agent orchestration patterns (tool calling, multi-agent delegation, human-in-the-loop flows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping high-quality open-source or customer-facing APIs and caring deeply about API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Compensation:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New York, NY base pay range for this role is $208,000-$312,000. Actual salary will be based on job-related skills, experience, and location. Compensation outside of NYC may be adjusted based on employee location. The total compensation package may include benefits, equity-based compensation, and eligibility for a company bonus or variable pay program depending on the role. Your recruiter can share more details during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KR1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vercel.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; for more information on how we handle your data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Vercel is committed to fostering and empowering an inclusive community within our organization. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Vercel encourages everyone to apply for our available positions, even if they don&#39;t necessarily check every box on the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product &amp;amp; Platform Security team at Toast protects the cloud infrastructure and services that restaurants depend on every day. We are looking for a Staff Engineer, Cloud Security to expand the scope and coverage of our cloud security capabilities. You will join an existing cloud security team and take a role in setting direction for how Toast secures its cloud environments. This is a hands-on role with technical leadership responsibilities: you will build and operate security tooling and controls yourself, while also shaping strategy, mentoring teammates, and influencing the roadmaps of engineering teams across R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our footprint is primarily AWS. You will work closely with Platform and Infrastructure teams in R&amp;amp;D, and with Defense &amp;amp; Response and other Security Engineering teams within Trust &amp;amp; Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and operate our Cloud-Native Application Protection Platform (CNAPP), including tuning, coverage, integrations, and turning findings into prioritized, actionable work for engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cloud security posture management (CSPM) across our AWS organization and accounts, defining standards and measuring adherence over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive identity and access management improvements, including least privilege, role and permission design, and reducing standing access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure our container environments, from image and workload security to cluster configuration and runtime protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build guardrails and secure defaults into infrastructure as code and deployment pipelines, so that teams get secure configurations by default rather than through review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform secure architecture reviews and threat modeling for new and existing cloud services and platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our SOC on cloud detection coverage, logging, and investigation readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and improve cloud vulnerability and misconfiguration remediation programs, working with engineering owners to drive risk down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in security incident response, including on-call coverage, and lead the cloud side of investigations and follow-up work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the multi-year direction for cloud security at Toast, and mentor and uplevel other engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with Platform, Infrastructure, and product engineering leaders, and influence their priorities through data and clear risk communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in security engineering, infrastructure, or software engineering, with significant time focused on cloud security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on experience securing AWS environments at scale, including IAM, Organizations, networking, logging, and core security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating cloud security tooling, such as CNAPP or CSPM platforms (for example Orca, Wiz, or Upwind).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with container and Kubernetes security (for example EKS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing threat modeling and security architecture reviews for cloud services and platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience responding to security incidents in cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with infrastructure as code (for example Terraform) and in at least one programming language used for automation (for example Python or Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading cross-team technical initiatives and influencing engineering teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of setting technical direction for a security domain, including a multi-year roadmap and the decisions behind it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including explaining risk and tradeoffs to engineers and leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will help you stand out (Nonessentials/Nice to Haves)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP, Azure, or other cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud detection engineering or incident response in cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with compliance frameworks relevant to payments and SaaS, such as PCI DSS or SOC 2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications, such as AWS Certified Security Specialty or CCSP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers or growing a security function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at Toast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, one of our company values is that we&#39;re hungry to build and learn. We believe learning new AI tools empowers us to build for our customers faster, more independently, and with higher quality. We provide these tools across all disciplines, from Engineering and Product to Sales and Support, and are inspired by how our Toasters are already driving real value with them. The people who thrive here are those who embrace changes that let us build more for our customers; it’s a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Total Rewards Philosophy&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We strive to provide competitive compensation and benefits programs that help to attract, retain, and motivate the best and brightest people in our industry. Our total rewards package goes beyond great earnings potential and provides the means to a healthy lifestyle with the flexibility to meet Toasters’ changing needs. Learn more about our benefits at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is listed below. The starting salary will be determined based on skills, experience, and geographic location. In addition to base salary, our total rewards components include cash compensation (overtime, bonus/commissions if eligible), equity, and benefits. You can learn more about how we align pay with local labor markets in our &lt;a class=&quot;in-cell-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/us-pay-zones&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Geographic Pay Zone Philosophy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone A&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$193,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$309,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone B&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$269,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone C&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$151,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$242,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Toast Uses AI in its Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Throughout the hiring process, our goal is to get to know you. We use AI tools to support our recruiters and interviewers with tasks like note-taking, summarization, and documentation of interviews to ensure they can be fully focused on your conversation. All hiring decisions are made by people. We ask that you complete interviews and assessments on your own, without real-time AI tools, recording, or transcription bots, unless we tell you otherwise in advance. To learn more: &lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We embrace a hybrid work model that fosters in-person collaboration while valuing individual needs. Our goal is to build a strong culture of connection as we work together to empower the hospitality community, regardless of location. Please visit the Locations page on our career site to learn more about our in-office expectations by region:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Are the Secret Ingredient in Our Recipe for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, our employees are our secret ingredient—when they thrive, we thrive. The restaurant industry brings together people with a wide range of backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we value that same breadth at Toast. We strive to build a culture grounded in authenticity, respect, and humility, where every Toaster has a real opportunity to grow, contribute, and do their best work—raising the bar in delivering exceptional experiences for our customers and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is committed to creating an accessible and inclusive hiring process. As part of this commitment, we strive to provide reasonable accommodations for persons with disabilities to enable them to access the hiring process. If you need an accommodation to access the job application or interview process, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidateaccommodations@toasttab.com&quot;&gt;candidateaccommodations@toasttab.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
